/Alt (Civic Continuity Protocol\073 Decision\055ready\056 Implementation\055gated\056 Zhongzhiyuan AI Innovation Acceleration Area serves as the Open Testbed\056 Option B\054 Distributed service nodes\056 Provisional concept grid\054 not an official boundary\056 Public value is read first\056 Conditional study sequence\072 N \267 Evidence baseline \050ALT\055ZZY\055N\051 \055\076 A \267 Controlled validation cell \050ALT\055ZZY\055A\051 \055\076 B \267 Distributed service nodes \050ALT\055ZZY\055B\051\073 study lead\072 ALT\055ZZY\055A\056 Project loop LOOP\055PROJECT\055EVIDENCE\055DECISION\072 REVISE returns to evidence and STOP returns to N while retaining evidence\073 production loop LOOP\055PRODUCTION\055GENERATE\055VERIFY\072 validation failure returns to revision and sealing waits for every seal condition\056 Public value\072 Withdrawable service nodes lower trial barriers for enterprises and small businesses\056 Footprint\072 Three removable service nodes\073 positions U Flow\072 Node\055by\055node\073 isolate or withdraw Beneficiary\072 enterprises and small businesses facing high trial barriers \267 people requiring a non\055digital entry during outages Burdens\072 distributed accountability \267 vendor lock\055in \267 unequal service distribution \267 multi\055node maintenance and training Exit\072 Retire nodes individually\073 export in open formats\073 preserve non\055digital entry during outages\056 Gate\072 BLK\055X1\055OFFICIAL\055SPATIAL \267 BLK\055X2\055FIELD\055INTERFACES \267 BLK\055X4\055OPERATING\055AUTHORITY \267 BLK\055X5\055COST\055EXIT \267 BLK\055X6\055INDEPENDENT\055VALIDATION Unknowns\072 Exact parcel\054 entrance\054 alignment\054 ownership\054 control and deployment geometry \267 Observed accessibility\054 demand\054 benefit\054 burden\054 dissent and distributional effect \267 Named authority\054 staffing\054 cost\054 procurement\054 exit performance and independent validation The OSM context is an exact path extract from a byte\055closed R005 SVG\073 the option overlay is not spatially registered\056 The graphic scale uses concept units CU\054 not metres\056 Applicable gate IDs\072 BLK\055X1\055OFFICIAL\055SPATIAL\054 BLK\055X2\055FIELD\055INTERFACES\054 BLK\055X4\055OPERATING\055AUTHORITY\054 BLK\055X5\055COST\055EXIT\054 BLK\055X6\055INDEPENDENT\055VALIDATION\056 Claims\072 I\055ALT\055ZZY\055B\054 U\055SPATIAL\055LOCATION\054 U\055REAL\055USE\054 U\055IMPLEMENTATION\056 Sources\072 SRC\055R006\055MODEL\054 SRC\055R005\055METRICS\054 SRC\055R005\055OSM\055ZZY\054 SRC\055R005\055GEOMETRY\054 SRC\055R005\055ARCHIVE\056 Bid claims\072 I\055CIVIC\055CONTINUITY\055PROTOCOL\054 I\055BRIEF\055ALIGNMENT\055001\054 I\055CONDITIONAL\055PATH\055001\054 I\055DECISION\055REQUEST\055001\054 I\055PROGRAMME\055100D\055001\054 I\055DELIVERY\055CONTROLS\055001\054 I\055SELF\055LOOP\055001\054 U\055BID\055ADMIN\055INPUT\055001\056 Bid sources\072 SRC\055R006\055MODEL\054 SRC\055OFFICIAL\055BRIEF\055FACTS\05520260509\056)
